	(text "Console 5V (slot pin 13, CONS_5V) through the AO3401A (gate = VBUS: fully on without USB, body diode only with\nUSB, so nothing back-feeds the console); USB VBUS through the SS34; R_VBPD 4.7k holds the gate low against the\nSS34's reverse leakage.  +5V: SRAM, glue, WS2812, buck, RP LDO.  +3V3 (buck): S3, microSD, CP2102N.  +3V3_RP\n(LDO, rises with the 5V rail): every RP2354B supply pin, so its 5V-tolerant pads are powered before the bus is."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.18 129.54 0)
		(effects
